grafspace / grafverse — LICENSING
Copyright © 2026 sun-dive

This repository is MULTI-LICENSED. Each source file carries a one-line header
naming the licence that governs it. The full text of every licence used is
included once, below. Where a file's header points to "LICENSE", it means this
file.

  •  BMF format codec  ·  bmf-codec.js
         → MIT License
         The Block Media Format (BRC-224) codec is an open standard — implement
         and reuse it freely, on any chain or none.

  •  On-chain core  ·  mint/  (covenant, wallet, editions, BMF atoms)
         → Open BSV License Version 6
         Derived from PHAR LAP / MPT. May only be used on the BSV Blockchain.

  •  BRC-226 demonstrations  ·  brc226.html, battery.html, tip.php, battery.php
         → Open BSV License Version 6
         Working reference examples of the self-running counter and the Bitcoin
         battery, published so anyone can read, test, fork and run them. These are
         demonstrations of the protocol, not game or application code.

  •  Game & application  ·  grafverse.html, wallet/, handoff.php, .cpanel.yml
         → Business Source License 1.1
         The grafspace game engine and application code. Source-available;
         non-production and non-competing use is granted now; converts to the
         MIT License on the Change Date.

Provenance: this codebase is timestamped on-chain at each release. The release
mint txid is recorded with the tagged release / in NOTICE.

